# Managed by the FBS Interlock Gateway installer.
# Permit the authorized FBS source and reject every other inbound connection
# to the gateway listener range. Preserve loopback access for local testing.
pass in quick on lo0 proto tcp from any to any port @FBS_PORT_RANGE@ keep state
pass in quick proto tcp from @FBS_SOURCE_IP@ to any port @FBS_PORT_RANGE@ keep state
block in quick proto tcp from any to any port @FBS_PORT_RANGE@
